# Rank

Import RankScore from "./rank_score.lg".
Import RankTrail from "./rank_trail.lg".
Import TrailRecord from "./trail_record.lg".
Import TrailMemory from "./trail_memory.lg".

The scheduler's priority for a problem: the base score its atlas profile earns
(`rank_score.lg`), moved by what its own trail has shown (`rank_trail.lg`).

## Note
A problem's priority, in basis points.

## To priority (r: RankInputs, s: TrailSignals) -> Int:
    Return scaledPriority(baseScore(r), r's tractable, s).

## Note
The signals of a trail.

## To trailSignals (trail: Seq of TrailEntry) -> TrailSignals:
    Return a new TrailSignals with verified verifiedCount(trail) and repeats repeatedFailures(trail).
